RESULTS RECEIVED
----------------

#1: When grading starts

{
	"subid": 3,
	"restype": 1,
	"status": "Compiling on Grader"
}

#2: When compilation ends

{
	"subid": 3,
	"restype": 2,
	"status": "Running on Subtask 1 Test 1",
	"compilation": "Compiled Successfully in C++11 using 1.62s",
	"compileok": 1,
}

#3: When test case is done (tc 1 in this case)

{
	"subid": 3,
	"restype": 3,
	"status": "Running on Subtask 1 Test 2",
	"tc": {"subtask": 1, "num": 1, "msg": "OK", "score": 100, "exec": 0, "wall": 0.044, "ram": 1.8, "stat": 0}
}

#4: When subtask + test case is done (tc 2, subtask 1)

{
	"subid": 3,
	"restype": 4,
	"status": "Running on Subtask 2 Test 1",
	"tc": {"subtask": 1, "num": 2, "msg": "OK", "score": 100, "exec": 0, "wall": 0.044, "ram":b1.8, "stat": 0}
	"subtask": {"num": 1, "score": 50 },
}

#5: When everything is done (i.e. last tc of last subtask is done)

{
	"subid": 3,
	"restype": 5,
	"status": "Judging completed in 6.2s",
	"graded_date": "2015-05-26 22:38:24", // iso 8601 date strings
	"subtask": {"num": 2, "score": 50 },
	"tc": {"subtask": 2, "num": 1, "msg": "OK", "score": 100, "exec": 0, "wall": 0.044, "ram": 1.8, "stat": 0} //ram is in MB
	"maxtime": 0,
	"verdict": "accepted",
	"totalscore": 100
}

#6: Rejected submissions

{
	"subid": 3,
	"restype": 6,
	"status": "Judging failed",
	"verdict": "failed",
	"graded_date": "2015-05-26 22:38:24"
}

HOW TO CHANGE LANGUAGES
-----------------------
Change languages object settings.js in both public/js and controllers
Change languages in forms in problem & submission page (yeah, really stupid and tedious)

SOCKET OPERATIONS
-----------------

Sending Data

io.to('authed').emit('dataTypeName (any string)', messageObj)

authed is a group (.to('whatever') can be omitted)
dataTypeName is any string
messageObj can be any data type

Receiving Data

socket.on('dataTypeName',function(messageObj){

});

dataTypeName is any string
messageObj can be any data type

DATA TYPE NAMES USED FOR SOCKETS
--------------------------------
newSub - new submission
updateSub - update from grader about submission